<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan details seeding progress to May 11.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan details seeding progress to May 11.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on</p>
<p>Tuesday detailed the level of seeding progress to Sunday. (In</p>
<p>percent of total seedings)</p>
<p>	   S. Wheat  Durum  Oats  Barley  Flax  Canola All Crops</p>
<p>May 11	 11	22     2     5	 0	4	10</p>
<p>Five-yr avg  11	22     6     6	 1	2	10</p>
<p>Spcl Crps Mustard  Sunflower    Lentils  Peas  Canary Seed</p>
<p>May 11	  6	 4	     20	14     6</p>
<p>Five-yr avg   4	 2	     17	 8     8</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
